@startuml 03_battle_manager

[*] --> PlayerTurn

PlayerTurn --> Targeting : play card / attack
Targeting --> PlayerTurn : resolve
PlayerTurn --> EnemyTurn : end turn
EnemyTurn --> PlayerTurn : enemy abilities done
PlayerTurn --> Victory : all enemies dead
Victory --> ReturnMap : worldmap_ReturnToMapAfterVictory

note right of PlayerTurn
  OBJ_BattleManager
  SCR_Battle_Step
  scr_battle_turn
  scr_battle_play
end note

@enduml
